                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "html": "Gene Kogan",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "The original creator of Abraham, he played a key role in the Little Martians AI development. He’s been a major source of inspiration, has developed several of the tools used for the project development and has collaborated as an artist in Little Martian projects.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
