                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "html": "Simon de la Rouviere",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "He's mostly known as the creator of the first generative art on chain Little Martians. He also was responsible for editing the story ‘Little Martians and the Human Memorial Monument' as part of the ‘Logged Universe’ series. Plus, he was the inspiration for the expansive NFTs storytelling universe model.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
